{
  "slug": "obsidian-knowledge",
  "name": "Obsidian Knowledge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Self-evolving Claude Code plugin that manages an Obsidian knowledge vault: capture, organize, index, garden — plus a meta-skill that improves the harness itself.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `obsidian-knowledge` (Read, search, and create notes in the Obsidian vault/wiki memory store), `remember-conversations` (Selectively file durable, novel conversation outcomes as canonical vault notes), `vault-organizer` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"organize the vault\", \"update indexes\", \"fix broken links\",…)\n- **Commands** (1): `scan-secrets` (Scan the current vault for leaked secrets on demand)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install obsidian-knowledge@claude-community` from `crypdick/obsidian-knowledge`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
